Error [E0312]: `Scoreboard` can't be compared with `Scoreboard` because field `data` doesn't support `==`
  --> tests/ui/incomparable_eq.jet:5:48
    |
  5 | fn same(a: Scoreboard, b: Scoreboard) Bool -> (a == b)
    |                                                ^^^^^^
 Why: value equality needs every field to support the comparison
 Fix: compare individual fields instead
